        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:258.1000061035156,37.31666564941406,189.89999389648438,342.90000915527344",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "side a",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>If the agent wants to write a marriage contract for him who sent him, to secure</li>\n<li>the marriage with the woman whom he took for his sender with the power of attorney which is</li>\n<li>in his possession, he writes the marriage contract according to this form. On day X</li>\n<li>of the week, in month X, of year such and such of the era of documents: There came</li>\n<li>before us sound and validated testimony that X b. Y</li>\n<li>had performed a complete stringent qinyan, with an implement fit for doing so,</li>\n<li>(to affirm) that he had appointed X b. Y as agent to betroth for him&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(Miss) X daughter of Y; and that whatever he stipulates as an obligation upon him and whatever he undertakes</li>\n<li>as stipulations, he takes upon himself. He has made his jurisdiction like his (own) jurisdiction.</li>\n<li>And this X may not say to him, to this X, his agent, \"For (my) benefit</li>\n<li>I sent you and not for (my) detriment.\" And whatever he undertakes as stipulations</li>\n<li>and the advanced and delayed marriage payments are accepted by him. Following</li>\n<li>this, X the agent said, intentionally, voluntarily,</li>\n<li>and willingly, not coerced, not enticed, and not</li>\n<li>intoxicated, rather, wholeheartedly, and with full senses, (that he desired)</li>\n<li>to betroth X daughter of Y. And thus did he say to her, \"Be to X</li>\n<li>b. Y betrothed (mequddeshet) as wife. And he shall sustain, provide for,</li>\n<li>clothe, and esteem you, in the manner of Jewish</li>\n<li>men, who serve, nourish, provide for, clothe, esteem,</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"b8fef67a93c25f964d31a92b9b292454\"",
