      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "side c",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>not like promises nor like formularies, rather according to stringencies of all documents</li>\n<li>validated in court. And we performed a qinyan with X b. Y, the messenger, for all</li>\n<li>that is written and specified above, with an implement fit for doing so.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong, firm, and valid. And they sign.</li></ol>\n",
